    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλειτύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύος</span>, ἡ, acc. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλειτῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.390
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνω</span>):—<i>slope,
				hillside</i>, Il.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.470
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παρνησίαν ὑπὲρ κλειτύν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1145
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Limen.
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τιρυνθίαν πρὸς κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					271
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐγ Κλειτύϊ</span>
			(placename) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).1076.38
			</span></i> (Ceos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>). [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> in acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλειτύν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
				</span></i>
			 l.c., elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
			</span></i>l.c., etc.: freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλι</span>- in
			codd., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλει</span>- in <u>IG</u>
			and Limen.Il.cc., cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.416
			</span></i>.]</div>
